* geographic scope;
* duration;
* distribution rights;
* sublicensing rights;
* fees or royalties;
* attribution requirements;
* branding requirements; and
* other conditions.

### 2.10 "Neko-Nikki Marks"

"Neko-Nikki Marks" means names, logos, symbols, project names, product names,
